      {
       "text": "Fixes a strange occasional bug on tip 14",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a rare occurrence of some tips and endings being unlocked on opening the game",
